<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n640" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ăcūlĕātus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		aculeus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>furnished with stings</i> or <i>prickles</i>,
				<i>thorny</i>, <i>prickly.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, of animals and plants: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animalia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 20, 22, 91</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bruchus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Jer. 51, 27</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">herbae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 24, 19, 119</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ictus,</span>”
				<i>a puncture made by a sting</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					20, 21, 84, § 223</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Fig.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Stinging</i>, <i>pointed</i>, <i>sharp</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">istaec ... aculeata sunt, animum fodicant,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Bacch. 1, 1, 30</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">litterae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 14, 18, 1</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Subtle</i>, <i>cunning</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">contorta et aculeata sophismata,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Ac. 2, 24</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
